SWEET immediate vsync tick on enable (patch 0166, boot-arg sweetvsync_imm=1, default off; research 60 lever 2, research 52): when CoreAnimation enables vsync notifications (selector 72, type 5, CA_FORCE_TIMER=1 path) send ONE vsync callback immediately (host time now, count unchanged, the 16.7 ms timer keeps its cadence) instead of waiting up to a period; skipped while the display is off or the QR log holds the panel; at most one immediate tick per vsync period; counts enables, ticks sent and skipped and logs them (after the lock is dropped) for the first 10 enables and then every 50 (SWEET FB: vsync_imm: ...), one 'sweetvsync_imm on|off' line at the first enable. Consumer of docs/research/60 and 52 (G-13).
